OL,3,AKeir Starmer announces he is standing
OL,4,Adown as MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in a surprise statement hours
OL,7,Fbefore his successor Andy Burnham made
OL,8,Fhis debut in the House of Commons, he
OL,9,Fsaid he was resigning to work on issues
OL,10,Fsuch as international affairs and
OL,11,Fviolence against women and girls.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
