OL,3,A'I've never been to Afghanistan': Six
OL,4,Amillion deportees forced to start over
OL,5,Aunder the Taliban
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe elderly grimace, hobbling on
OL,8,Fcrutches, and wide-eyed children stare,
OL,9,Fcradling chickens carried from homes
OL,10,Fthey were forced to leave behind.
OL,12,F"It feels good to be in my own
OL,13,Fcountry," 35-year-old Nazia says, just
OL,14,Fminutes after she crosses from
OL,15,FPakistan, where she was born, into
OL,16,FAfghanistan.
OL,18,FThe Torkham crossing, known as "Zero
OL,19,FPoint", is where one hard life ends and
OL,20,Fanother begins.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
